    "created_at": "2024-12-18T15:37:40Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-12-18T15:37:40Z",
    "body": "I don't think you'll find agreement on this as due to its nature `<plaintext>` has caused numerous security issues.\r\n\r\nPerhaps @whatwg/i18n have suggestions for portable plain text, including language annotation and the like.",
